OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of M60 closed due to
OL,4,Apolice incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M60 has been closed in
OL,7,Fboth directions, leading to long
OL,8,Fdelays.
OL,10,FDrivers were warned by National
OL,11,FHighways to expect delays of more than
OL,12,F50 minutes after the stretch of
OL,13,Fmotorway between Junction 17 at
OL,14,FPrestwich and Junction 18 at Simister
OL,15,FInterchange was closed.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police are dealing
OL,18,Fwith the incident, National Highways
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,21,FIt added that there were diversions in
OL,22,Fplace.
